{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray<MLNPolygon *>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The area occupied by any interior polygons is excluded from the overall shape."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Interior polygons should not overlap. An interior polygon should not have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interior polygons of its own."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there are no interior polygons, the value of this property is "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNPolygon(py)interiorPolygons","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"interiorPolygons","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","title":"interiorPolygons","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon\/interiorPolygons","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of polygons nested inside the receiver."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon\/interiorpolygons"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/docume